From: docker-whisper-live downstream backport
Subject: Fix WebSocket API-key authentication with websockets 16.1

Backport of the production-code change merged upstream in commit
bde730b81bb23b5286470524d5f527caf6a8b9e0 for WhisperLive issue #532.
This patch is intentionally limited to WhisperLive v0.9.0 and can be removed
when the packaged upstream release includes that commit.

diff --git a/whisper_live/server.py b/whisper_live/server.py
--- a/whisper_live/server.py
+++ b/whisper_live/server.py
@@ -8,7 +8,9 @@ import functools
